  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=150%><b>A Birb Game</b></size>\r\nUn jeu de l'Association N\xE9o-n\xE9o-militante
    Chaisiste du C\xE9gep Limoilou\n\n\n\n<b>\xC9QUIPE</b>\n\nArtiste environnement
    et \xE9clairage\nLudovic Tanguay\n\nProgrammeur gameplay\nF\xE9lix Bouchard\n\nProgrammeur
    gameplay\nFr\xE9d\xE9rik Richer Balthazard\n\nProgrammeur interface et exp\xE9rience
    utilisateur\nIsma\xEBl Barbeau-Kassouba\n\n<b>MUSIQUE</b>\nMusiques originales\nPaul
    Moreau\nTous droits r\xE9serv\xE9s\n\n<b>EFFETS SONORES</b>\r\nGulp\r\nfreesound_community,
    Pixabay\r\n\r\nObject Falling\r\nfreeeverythingxx, Pixabay\r\n\r\nHard Object
    Drop\r\nPixabay\r\n\r\nLicence Pixabay\n\n<b>PERSONNAGES</b>\r\nChevalier : Knight
    D Pelegrini\r\nAnimations : Laying Moaning, Laying Idle, Laying Sleeping,\r\nLaying
    Mild Cough, Standing Torch Idle, Sitting Dazed, Taking a Pill\r\nMixamo (Adobe)\r\n\r\nOiseau\r\nDinoPunch,
    Unity Asset Store\r\nLicence standard de l'Asset Store\n\n\r\n\r\n<b>D\xC9CORS</b>\r\nCrooked
    Medieval Watchtower\r\nMutasim, Sketchfab\r\nCC BY 4.0\r\n\r\nFree Stone Mage
    Tower\r\nGameAssetsFin, Sketchfab\r\n\r\nTower of Wizardi\r\nill_drakon, Sketchfab\r\n\r\n\n<b>EFFETS
    VISUELS</b>\r\nParticle Light (rayons lumineux)\r\nDark Cube Studios, Unity Asset
    Store\r\n\r\nPolygonal's Low Poly Particle Pack (feu)\r\nUnity Asset Store\r\n\r\nLicence
    standard de l'Asset Store\r\n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n<b>TEXTURES</b>\r\nPoly Haven, CC0\r\n\r\nSparse
    Grass, Marble Cliff 01, Marble Cliff 05\r\nAmal Kumar\r\n\r\nGrass Ground\r\nCharlotte
    Baglioni\r\n\r\nRoots\r\nDario Barresi, Dimitrios Savva\r\n\r\nRock Boulder Dry\r\nDimitrios
    Savva, Rico Cilliers\r\n\r\nForest Leaves 02, Aerial Beach 01, Brown Mud Dry,
    Snow 02\r\nRob Tuytel\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>REMERCIEMENTS</b>\r\nMathieu Piette, enseignant\r\n\r\n\r\n<size=120%>Merci
    d'avoir jou\xE9 !</size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
